    "description": "One Of The World\u2019s Most Climate-Vulnerable Nations, One Of The Least Prepared: Sri Lanka\u2019s Deadly Choice",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/one-of-the-worlds-most-climate-vulnerable-nations-one-of-the-least-prepared-sri-lankas-deadly-choice/",
    "lang": "en",
