    "description": "Single National Asset Tax (SNAT): A bold blueprint for disaster recovery, economic revolution",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Single-National-Asset-Tax-SNAT-A-bold-blueprint-for-disaster-recovery-economic-revolution/14-785927",
