    "chunk_text": "Chinese Dragon Caf\u00e9 opens flagship outlet in Galle\n\nChinese Dragon Caf\u00e9 (CDC) has opened its 10th Sri Lankan outlet in Galle, located at 45 Colombo Rd, Kaluwella. Founded in 1942, the renowned restaurant brand has grown from a local eatery into a national household name, with an international branch in Dubai.\n\nThe Galle launch underscores CDC\u2019s expansion commitment, bringing its signature dishes like Hot Butter Cuttlefish to new communities. The brand also offers delivery, catering, and online ordering.\n\nCDC CEO Gayan Fernando stated the move responds to loyal southern province customers, aiming to become a familiar name in the area. The opening reinforces CDC\u2019s mission to share its authentic Sri Lankan Chinese flavours nationwide.\n\nOgilvy Group continues winning streak at Campaign Asia Agency of the Year Awards\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
