    "description": "When backing grows stronger, and when it subtly declines",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/When-backing-grows-stronger-and-when-it-subtly-declines/4-786063",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
